{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>網上流傳一條車CAM，顯示今日（4日）中午12時左右，一輛白色Tesla在九龍灣啟祥道近宏光道疑衝紅燈，攔腰猛撼一輛駛至的九巴。Tesla車頭損毀，有配件丟落；巴士頓時停下。網民紛紛留言質疑涉事司機沒有專心駕駛，又斥「睇唔開都唔好累人呀！」</p><figure><img alt=\"啟祥道已經轉紅燈。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150073200651014144093756.jpeg/2gOO6GDvvhoNzXatRMZZKXvIKGyKyeNBw9ipE8PYqRM\"/><figcaption>啟祥道已經轉紅燈。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla由左二線切線到左三線。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150073202937040896368120.jpeg/Bf9adlNl0o2kvpmWIIes3LH711WDk1H_Isq4ySLKuMk\"/><figcaption>Tesla由左二線切線到左三線。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla由左二線切線到左三線。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150073205080461312394710.jpeg/rm7SQi31SepL7oXIHs05NSAQglC9_GP18PGHSfDxh0k\"/><figcaption>Tesla由左二線切線到左三線。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>由網上的兩條車CAM可見，涉事Tesla沿啟祥道南行，至宏光道交界處前它由左二線切到左三線；其時啟祥道已轉紅燈，宏光道的車輛亦陸續開行。惟Tesla直衝駛出，結果攔腰撞落九巴的車身。</p><figure><img alt=\"Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150074960102821888769421.jpeg/XbRNuv12s2ukGJWx4Uqy68nmY1w4jxj1vrcIvb63CL0\"/><figcaption>Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150074962535649280591287.jpeg/yffNL6s5BExMaFKNo21BK-0DW5b7pHOZjMwYNIzMGDQ\"/><figcaption>Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150074964989448192329701.jpeg/Fy_jHxalk1XK937hbwi3tAGOb7W7qcmFLXveai173mo\"/><figcaption>Tesla攔腰撞九巴左邊車身。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla車頭損毀。（車CAM截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260704/1150074967254503424184325.jpeg/EMPttoWuTXPh1aeS6UP2NkCU8P-88dkQ3sbizd7G4s0\"/><figcaption>Tesla車頭損毀。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>警方稱，今日中午11時56分，私家車與巴士在啟祥道與宏光道交界相撞，事故中無人受傷，原因有待調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-04T06:38:22.281987+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":421,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}